<!--
  The mark: two rings that are one ring, with a seam that does not close.

  It reads as the project's claim rather than as a logo -- a kernel half and a
  rootfs half drawn as a single stroke, so there is no gap between them to point
  at. The seam is a small break because the shape is two arcs, not one circle.
-->
